"""
TutorAgent - The controller/orchestrator for language learning sessions.

系统是项目内自研的 FastAPI Agent harness；没有直接运行 Hermes、
LangGraph 或 OpenAI Agents SDK。部分会话、记忆和技能设计借鉴了
Hermes Agent / DeepAgents，并在此基础上实现语言教学专用能力。

架构层次：
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  教学技能系统（领域专属能力）            │
│  - CEFR/JLPT 等级匹配                   │
│  - 错误类型驱动的动态技能激活           │
│  - 漂移检测与纠正                       │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  项目内 FastAPI Agent harness            │
│  - 教学编排、持久化记忆、会话管理         │
│  - 渐进式触发与证据审计                  │
│  - 会话上下文冻结与自动压缩              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘

Hermes/DeepAgents 在本项目中是设计参考，不是运行时依赖。

Role: NOT the conversational AI itself. The agent is a controller that:
1. Loads relevant teaching skills (tools) at session start
2. Injects them into the live model''s context
3. Monitors conversation to keep output aligned with learning goals
4. Detects when output drifts and activates corrective skills
5. Extracts learnings for autonomous evolution

Flow:
    User speaks → Live model (OpenAI Realtime) processes → Agent monitors
    Agent detects error → Injects correct skill tool → Model responds with strategy
    Agent detects drift → Activates guardrail → Conversation back on track
"""

